<!-- blocks/_marquee-gallery-image.liquid -->

{%- comment -%}
  Data-only child of _marquee-gallery. Emits the image (rendered at a generous
  default width) and an optional href, wrapped in leetspeak markers so the
  parent gallery can splice the rendering into its own dimensional frame.
  See _callout-group.liquid for the same pattern. Grep g4lleryx to find every
  related marker.
{%- endcomment -%}

